# Accepted findings, each with its reason and an expiry. Trivy reads this
# file from the repository root.

# CVE-2026-84782, openssl 3.5.5-1ubuntu3.5 in
# mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/aspnet:11.0-resolute-chiseled. Ubuntu fixed it in
# 3.5.5-1ubuntu3.6 on 2026-09-30. Microsoft had not rebuilt the image that
# day: the tag still resolved to sha256:ec752d90. A chiseled image has no
# apt, so the fix arrives with the rebuilt digest through Dependabot.
# Production runs the same image today. The expiry makes the scan fail again
# if the rebuild has not landed by then.
CVE-2026-84782 exp:2026-10-14
